<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Hello {{email}},</h2>
  <p>We received a request to reset your password.</p>
  <p>Here is your reset token:</p>
  <pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 10px; font-size: 18px;">{{token}}</pre>
  <p>Copy this token and use it in the reset password API.</p>
  <p>If you didn't request this, ignore this email.</p>
  <p>Thanks,</p>
  <p>Your API Team</p>
</body>
</html>
